lisa-design:
- policy_data travels as a new `policyData map[string]interface{}` parameter on the plugin's own PolicyEvaluator.Generate (mirrors the agent's NewPolicyProcessor argument order), rather than a field on DefaultPolicyEvaluator: the evaluator is created once and Configure can run again with different policy_data, so the value lives on CloudCustodianPlugin and is passed per call.
- Configure always overwrites p.policyData: AsMap() when set, nil when unset, so a reconfigure without policy_data clears an earlier value (same as plugin-github-settings / plugin-file-attestation#7).
- google.golang.org/protobuf becomes a direct requirement only because the new test builds a structpb.Struct.

